@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071
@token = replace-with-login-token

### Offices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/offices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Leagues
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/offices/6193/leagues?seasonId=2026-27
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Teams
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leagues/194908/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Team detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leagues/194908/teams/181303
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown team
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leagues/194908/teams/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
